Each item below is small. Together they took our slowest template from "needs improvement" to "good" on all three metrics.

## Largest Contentful Paint

1. Serve the hero image in a modern format at the right size.
2. Preload it, and never lazy-load it.
3. Inline the critical CSS for the first screen.

```html
<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/hero-1280.webp" imagesrcset="/hero-640.webp 640w, /hero-1280.webp 1280w" imagesizes="100vw" />
```

## Cumulative Layout Shift

Give every image and embed its dimensions, and reserve space for anything that loads late.

```css
.embed {
  aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
  width: 100%;
}
```

{% callout type="tip" %}
The video embeds on this blog only load the player after a click, so they cost nothing until then.
{% /callout %}

## Interaction to Next Paint

Break up long tasks, and move work off the main thread.

```js
async function processAll(items) {
  for (const item of items) {
    process(item);
    // Let the browser handle input between chunks.
    await scheduler.yield();
  }
}
```
